      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773116039884,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Turbo Charger / Super Charger:\n(Presence of these increases heat and\npressure).\n\nCylinders & Valves per Cylinder: (Higher\ncount = more complex timing/sealing).\n\nTransmission Type: (DSG/DCT are\n\"Higher Risk\" than Manual or Torque\nConverters).\n\nEngine Type: (DI engines have carbon\nbuildup; Hybrid engines have battery\naging).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "81A9N2N-cgnuMe7t_UWGe",
      "originalText": "Turbo Charger / Super Charger: (Presence of these increases heat and pressure).\n\nCylinders & Valves per Cylinder: (Higher count = more complex timing/sealing).\n\nTransmission Type: (DSG/DCT are \"Higher Risk\" than Manual or Torque Converters).\n\nEngine Type: (DI engines have carbon buildup; Hybrid engines have battery aging).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
