      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773116150868,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kms Driven vs. Registration Year: (A car driven\n30,000km in 1 year is \"High Stress\").\n\nPower-to-Weight Ratio: (High-performance engines in\nlight cars often run at higher stress levels).\n\nEngine Displacement: (Small engines working hard to\nmove a heavy \"Gross Weight\" wear out faster).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kms Driven vs. Registration Year: (A car driven 30,000km in 1 year is \"High Stress\").\n\nPower-to-Weight Ratio: (High-performance engines in light cars often run at higher stress levels).\n\nEngine Displacement: (Small engines working hard to move a heavy \"Gross Weight\" wear out faster).",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
