      "versionNonce": 535498128,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1773116641611,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "$w_i$ = The Risk Weight (How\nmuch that part costs or how\noften it breaks).\n\n$f_i$ = The Feature Value\n(Usually 1 if present, 0 if not).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "J0qDSpZ_WGWjAeekcxcDq",
      "originalText": "$w_i$ = The Risk Weight (How much that part costs or how often it breaks).\n\n$f_i$ = The Feature Value (Usually 1 if present, 0 if not).",
